{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41686","headline":"赠江南从事张侍郎 · 陈陶","name":"赠江南从事张侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平南门馆凤皇毛，二十华轩立最高。\n几处谈天致云雨，早时文海得鲸鳌。\n姻联紫府萧窗贵，职称青钱绣服豪。\n江徼无虞才不展，衔杯终日咏离骚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}